          "jcr:created": "Fri Jul 19 2024 16:03:36 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h2><span style=\"font-size: 30.625px;\"><b><span class=\"futura-bold\">Falls in hospitals&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">can take a heavy toll</span></span></b></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Falls impact patient outcomes and experience, and impose a great cost on hospitals.</span><br>\n</p>\n",
