          "text": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">1,000,000 patients</span></span></b><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">in the U.S. experience a fall while being treated in the hospital each year.<sup>1</sup></span></p>\n",
