          "text": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">80 to 90% of falls</span></span></b></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">in hospitals are unassisted, and unassisted falls are more likely to result in injury.<sup>2</sup></span></p>\n",
