              "jcr:created": "Mon Oct 16 2023 21:09:19 GMT+0000",
              "text": "<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Get the eGuide: </span><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">Supporting hospital fall prevention strategies through smart, connected bed and stretcher workflows</span></span></span><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><br>\n</span></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Discover how one hospital reduced bed-related falls by 64.8%, and an adult ED in a level 1 trauma center decreased falls 27% using Stryker’s smart, connected beds and stretchers.<sup>5,6†&nbsp;</sup>Learn more about the solutions behind the results. Find out how we can help your team use a data-driven approach to supporting fall-prevention protocols and long-term success.</span></span></p>\n",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Aug 30 2024 11:44:28 GMT+0000",
              "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
